"""Reshapes the raw Census data that the pipeline still downloads into clean, block-level tables. This module holds only the Census-dependent reshapes — the Block Assignment Files that map every census block to its state, county, tract, and place, and the Address Count Listing that provides housing-unit counts per block. The FCC pivot and dasymetric-interpolation reshapes used to live here too, but they moved to the telecom transform layer once the authoritative FCC raw data became available directly in the BigQuery production database, leaving processing focused on the sources that are still fetched from the Census website."""
